* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Member    RMCTERR
* Version   3.5
* Function  Set error transaction RMCTNAT after a logon
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
* Maintenance
* uuuuuuuu yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Description
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
* fhi      2017-03-15 NOMALL-2008 Created.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING MONIT-GL
LOCAL
1 #TRACING                 (L)
END-DEFINE
CALLNAT 'NOMGSTEP' '*' G-NATRP-ERC
PERFORM RMGTRACE-GET-SETTINGS #TRACING
*ERROR-TA := 'RMCTNAT' /* return there if a CAT error occurs
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS
    'Error transaction set to:' *ERROR-TA
    TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
END
